# =====================================================================
# FULL-GMLC THREE-LOCATION PSAP CROSSCHECK v9 - COMPACT
# =====================================================================
# ID truth:
#   GMLC.PSAP_ID     <-> Boundary.NENA_ID   (canonical leading-zero match)
#   GMLC.FCC_PSAP_ID <-> Boundary.FCC_ID
#
# Names are display-only; never used for SAME/DIFFERENT.
#
# Locations:
#   CALLER   = LATITUDE/LONGITUDE
#   CELL     = CELL_LATITUDE/CELL_LONGITUDE
#   ESPOSREQ = ESPOSREQ_LOC_LATITUDE/ESPOSREQ_LOC_LONGITUDE
#
# Distance:
#   local PSAP-centered AEQD nearest-boundary point
#   + final WGS84 Geod measurement in meters.
#
# MIN/MEAN/MAX statistics = FINAL FILTERED COHORT only.
# =====================================================================

